## 2. Meal Plans Endpoints

### 2.1 Browse Meal Plans
**Endpoint:** `GET /api/meal-plans`  
**Authentication:** Optional  
**Description:** Get paginated list of meal plans with filtering

**Query Parameters:**
```
category?: string
duration_type?: "daily" | "weekly" | "monthly"
min_price?: number
max_price?: number
dietary_tags?: string[] (comma-separated)
search?: string
is_free?: boolean
limit?: number (default: 20, max: 100)
offset?: number (default: 0)
```

**Success Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "plans": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "title": "string",
        "description": "string",
        "duration_days": "number",
        "duration_type": "daily" | "weekly" | "monthly",
        "final_price": "number",
        "category": "string",
        "dietary_tags": ["string"],
        "difficulty_level": "beginner" | "intermediate" | "advanced",
        "is_free": "boolean",
        "is_featured": "boolean",
        "average_rating": "number",
        "total_purchases": "number",
        "provider": {
          "name": "string",
          "profile_image_url": "string"
        },
        "preview_meals": ["string"] // First 2-3 meal names
      }
    ],
    "total": "number",
    "has_more": "boolean"
  }
}
```

---

### 2.2 Get Meal Plan Details
**Endpoint:** `GET /api/meal-plans/:id`  
**Authentication:** Optional (affects response content)  
**Description:** Get detailed meal plan information

**Success Response (200) - Preview Mode (Anonymous/Non-purchased):**
```json
{
